From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan <ryan@esterlines.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:04:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Farble WebAudio script readouts with a page-wide
 fudge

Multiply getChannelData, copyFromChannel, and AnalyserNode copies by one
factor in [0.999, 1.000) from the ESO seed. Apply it once per buffer so
the live Float32Array does not compound. Playback and destination output
stay clean. Strict uses the same fudge.
